{:itonami.blueprint/id "cloud-itonami-isic-1313"
 :itonami.blueprint/name "Finishing of textiles"
 :itonami.blueprint/isic-rev5 "1313"
 :itonami.blueprint/domain :textile-finishing/contract-processing
 :itonami.blueprint/license "AGPL-3.0-or-later"
 :itonami.blueprint/social-impact [:worker-safety :chemical-handling-safety :effluent-discharge-compliance]
 :itonami.blueprint/governor :textile-finishing-operations-governor
 :itonami.blueprint/robotics true
 :itonami.blueprint/required-technologies [:robotics :identity :forms :dmn :bpmn :audit-ledger :cae]
 :itonami.blueprint/status :public-oss
 :itonami.blueprint/maturity :implemented
 :itonami.blueprint/implemented-slice
 "FinishingAdvisor ⊣ Textile Finishing Operations Governor, langgraph-clj
 StateGraph, append-only audit ledger. A plant OPERATIONS COORDINATION
 actor for textile finishing (dyeing, printing, bleaching, and
 mercerizing lines operating on customer-supplied greige fabric --
 contract processing, not primary fibre/yarn/fabric manufacturing) --
 not direct dyeing/printing-line control authority. Four ops
 (`:log-production-batch` / `:schedule-maintenance` /
 `:flag-safety-concern` / `:coordinate-shipment`), all `:effect
 :propose` only. Eleven concrete governor checks elaborate this
 blueprint's four HARD invariants: propose-only effect, closed op
 allowlist, closed proposal-effect allowlist (no direct dyeing/
 printing-line-equipment control), permanent direct-operate block,
 permanent effluent-discharge-permit-decision block, independent
 equipment verification/registration before maintenance scheduling,
 independent batch verification/registration before shipment
 coordination back to the customer, independent shipment-volume
 recompute against the batch's own logged finished yardage,
 double-schedule guard, colorfastness-grade validation, and
 shrinkage-rate plausibility validation. Safety-concern flagging
 (chemical-handling / effluent-discharge) ALWAYS escalates to a human
 plant supervisor; `:log-production-batch` is the only op eligible to
 auto-commit, and only at phase 3 when governor-clean."}
